# {{.Project}}

An opinionated GinKit framework application built on Gin.

## Development

```bash
go mod tidy
ginkit run
```

The runtime lives in the versioned `github.com/Alfian57/ginkit/framework`
dependency. Application routes, domains, services, and middleware belong in
this repository and can be customized without editing framework internals.

## Configuration

Copy `.env.example` to `.env`, then configure the database and environment.
Run `ginkit doctor` for actionable diagnostics.
